题吗？","source_cn":"诸位，诸位，安静！请依次发言，对，从你开始，有什么问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3114855CF8E80A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422625002:0":{"text":"我刚刚听到你质疑因度厄放走了龙？","source_cn":"我刚刚听到你质疑因度厄放走了龙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DEFEF0C4649D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422625003:0":{"text":"我、我没有……我只是，呃，不知道该干什么了！","source_cn":"我、我没有……我只是，呃，不知道该干什么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D0DA6E723EC16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422625004:0":{"text":"都怪这家伙！如果不是他搞出那么多乱七八糟的事，我还有个入城的奋斗目标！","source_cn":"都怪这家伙！如果不是他搞出那么多乱七八糟的事，我还有个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15EF0FAAD82F2C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422625005:0":{"text":"现在，想去地表上这家伙又不让……在这里怕不是在等死……","source_cn":"现在，想去地表上这家伙又不让……在这里怕不是在等死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5DED3AEBBB5DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422625006:0":{"text":"是啊，龙飞走了。那、那岂不是很快就没有恩典灵露了。","source_cn":"是啊，龙飞走了。那、那岂不是很快就没有恩典灵露了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568479BC7D8E435F","varian